# Workflow Rules

- Work one slice at a time.
- Use `docs/03-slices` as the source of truth for feature scope.
- Do not implement future slices unless explicitly asked.
- Do not refactor unrelated code.
- Prefer small, reviewable changes.
- Before large edits, summarize the intended files.
- After implementation, list tests to run.
